@startuml d10_state_defaulter
!include _style.iuml
' Figure title: Statechart diagram: attendance status of a student

[*] --> GoodStanding
state "Good standing" as GoodStanding : every course >= 75%\nis_defaulter = FALSE
state "Below 75% (live)" as Below : row in v_defaulter_list\nwarning on dashboard
state "Declared defaulter" as Declared : is_defaulter = TRUE
state "Recovered, still flagged" as Recovered : no row in v_defaulter_list\nis_defaulter still TRUE

GoodStanding --> Below : absences push a course < 75%
Below --> GoodStanding : attendance back to >= 75%\n(before declaration)
Below --> Declared : CALL sp_refresh_defaulter_flags()
Declared --> Recovered : attendance back to >= 75%
Recovered --> GoodStanding : CALL sp_refresh_defaulter_flags()
Declared --> Declared : CALL ... (still below 75%)
@enduml
